{"gospel":{"reference":"Matthieu 4, 18-23","title":"L'appel des premiers disciples","interlinear":[{"verse_number":"4, 18","translations":{"segond":"Comme il marchait le long de la mer de Galilée, il vit deux frères, Simon, appelé Pierre, et André, son frère, qui jetaient un filet dans la mer; car ils étaient pêcheurs.","darby":"Et comme il marchait le long de la mer de Galilée, il vit deux frères, Simon, appelé Pierre, et André, son frère, jetant un filet dans la mer, car ils étaient pêcheurs."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"περιπατῶν","gloss":"marchant"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"παρὰ","gloss":"le_long_de"},{"greek":"τὴν","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"θάλασσαν","gloss":"mer"},{"greek":"τῆς","gloss":"de_la"},{"greek":"Γαλιλαίας","gloss":"Galilée"},{"greek":"εἶδεν","gloss":"il_vit"},{"greek":"δύο","gloss":"deux"},{"greek":"ἀδελφούς,","gloss":"frères"},{"greek":"Σίμωνα","gloss":"Simon"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"λεγόμενον","gloss":"appelé"},{"greek":"Πέτρον","gloss":"Pierre"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"Ἀνδρέαν","gloss":"André"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"ἀδελφὸν","gloss":"frère"},{"greek":"αὐτοῦ,","gloss":"de_lui"},{"greek":"βάλλοντας","gloss":"jetant/lancer"},{"greek":"ἀμφίβληστρον","gloss":"filet"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"dans"},{"greek":"τὴν","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"θάλασσαν·","gloss":"mer"},{"greek":"ἦσαν","gloss":"ils_étaient"},{"greek":"γὰρ","gloss":"car"},{"greek":"ἁλιεῖς.","gloss":"pêcheurs"}]},{"verse_number":"4, 19","translations":{"segond":"Il leur dit : Suivez-moi, et je vous ferai pêcheurs d'hommes.","darby":"Et il leur dit : Suivez-moi, et je vous ferai pêcheurs d'hommes."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"λέγει","gloss":"dit"},{"greek":"αὐτοῖς·","gloss":"à_eux"},{"greek":"Δεῦτε","gloss":"Venez"},{"greek":"ὀπίσω","gloss":"après/à_la_suite_de"},{"greek":"μου,","gloss":"moi"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"ποιήσω","gloss":"je_ferai"},{"greek":"ὑμᾶς","gloss":"vous"},{"greek":"ἁλιεῖς","gloss":"pêcheurs"},{"greek":"ἀνθρώπων.","gloss":"d'hommes"}]},{"verse_number":"4, 20","translations":{"segond":"Aussitôt, ils laissèrent les filets, et le suivirent.","darby":"Et aussitôt, ayant laissé les filets, ils le suivirent."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"οἱ","gloss":"Eux"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"εὐθέως","gloss":"aussitôt"},{"greek":"ἀφέντες","gloss":"ayant_laissé/quitté"},{"greek":"τὰ","gloss":"les"},{"greek":"δίκτυα","gloss":"filets"},{"greek":"ἠκολούθησαν","gloss":"ils_suivirent"},{"greek":"αὐτῷ.","gloss":"lui"}]},{"verse_number":"4, 21","translations":{"segond":"De là étant allé plus loin, il vit deux autres frères, Jacques, fils de Zébédée, et Jean, son frère, qui étaient dans une barque avec Zébédée, leur père, et qui réparaient leurs filets. Il les appela,","darby":"Et étant passé de là, il vit deux autres frères, Jacques, fils de Zébédée, et Jean, son frère, dans la barque avec Zébédée leur père, raccommodant leurs filets ; et il les appela."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"προβὰς","gloss":"étant_allé_plus_loin/ayant_avancé"},{"greek":"ἐκεῖθεν","gloss":"de_là"},{"greek":"εἶδεν","gloss":"il_vit"},{"greek":"ἄλλους","gloss":"d'autres"},{"greek":"δύο","gloss":"deux"},{"greek":"ἀδελφούς,","gloss":"frères"},{"greek":"Ἰάκωβον","gloss":"Jacques"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"τοῦ","gloss":"de"},{"greek":"Ζεβεδαίου","gloss":"Zébédée"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"Ἰωάννην","gloss":"Jean"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"ἀδελφὸν","gloss":"frère"},{"greek":"αὐτοῦ,","gloss":"de_lui"},{"greek":"ἐν","gloss":"dans"},{"greek":"τῷ","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"πλοίῳ","gloss":"barque"},{"greek":"μετὰ","gloss":"avec"},{"greek":"Ζεβεδαίου","gloss":"Zébédée"},{"greek":"τοῦ","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"πατρὸς","gloss":"père"},{"greek":"αὐτῶν","gloss":"d'eux"},{"greek":"καταρτίζοντας","gloss":"réparant/ajustant"},{"greek":"τὰ","gloss":"les"},{"greek":"δίκτυα","gloss":"filets"},{"greek":"αὐτῶν,","gloss":"d'eux"},{"greek":"καὶ","gl